meta {
  name: SKI-2161 Echtzeit Testfälle
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}

docs {
  **Purpose**
  These realtime tests are for testing client and backend services to handle different use cases, when data are changing upon realtime situations.
  
  **How to use it:**
  Work with an environment which defines the variable "BearerToken" to get a token you need to contact opendata@sbb.ch and aks for an OJP 2.0 INT token. The called URL must be OJP 2.0 INT where the realtime data is forged to match the test. URL in tests: https://odpch-api.clients.liip.ch/ojp20-beta
  
  Other tokens (API keys) you can get here: https://api-manager.opentransportdata.swiss/
}
